k"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁もし自分が乃木坂に入ってなかったら誰推しですか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎乃木坂加入前は、花奈さん・みなみさんが推しメンでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂加入してからは、推し増しの日々です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆大分丸さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きーちゃーん！！！！\n微分積分いい気...？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎ぶんーーーーー！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆こっしー(じんじん)さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きぃちゃん オススメの小説教えてくだちい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎今は「蹴りたい背中」という小説を読んでます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆まるでぃ 塩アイスさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁好きなスポーツブランドありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎うーん、コンバースが好きだったかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、今はニューバランスが好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ナカヒロさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんはフライドポテトは好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎だ！い！す！き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ミヤビさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁サンクエトワールでシンメのひめたんと目が合ったりする？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎1A～1A'までは、ずっと目が合ってるよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆やっちさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁今ひなこが一番極めたい料理は何？？\n自分のためでも家族のためでも、どちらでも♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎自分のためになら、うな重！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族のためならなんだろうな～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆せーだいさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁「アドベンチャー・タイム」っていうアニメ知ってる？\nおかしなガムボールに似てるかも。\n面白いからよかったら今度見てみてね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎知ってるよー！！！時々見てる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆keitaさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁.寝れない時、きいちゃんはどーやって寝ようとしますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎チップの近くに行けばすぐ眠れます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆れんざぶさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁焼肉に行ったら必ず頼むものはある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎タン！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆あきらんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁テレビは角に置きますか？それとも180度開いてるところに置きますか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎角に置いてます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆しまさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁コメントがたくさんきてて大変だと思うけど、握手会でブログにコメントしてる名前を言ったらわかってくれたりしますか？\n4月の握手会にむけて毎日コメントして行きます(￣^￣)ゞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎握手会の時に、ブログのコメントと同じ名前の名札を見やすいところにつけてきてくださったら、覚えるのが早くなります！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前を言ってくれたらわかると思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆勇者きゃの丸さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁シュガーバターの木っていうお菓子知ってる？おいしいからおすすめー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎知らない！！！気になる！！！美味しそうー！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆はせがわさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁まいちゅんとは運命共同体だから、\nきいちゃん昨日も誕生日ってことになるの？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎そうはなりません！！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんとはそういう運命共同体じゃありません！！！私の誕生日は、私のお母さんが私を産んでくれた7月17日です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆まきさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁今日の夕方から雪降るけどきぃちゃんは雪遊びで1番何が好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎降らなかった。。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆まるしゅうさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁あだ名つけるとき\n名前見せたほうがつけやすい？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎名前を見せてもらったほうがつけやすいです！！！見た目であだ名をつけるのは苦手です。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ひろきちさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁みさ先輩に誕生日プレゼントあげた？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎実はまだ